---
import InfoLayout from '../layouts/InfoLayout.astro';
import { SITE_CONFIG } from '../config/site';

// The advertising section describes AdSense only once ads are actually switched on
const adsEnabled = Boolean(import.meta.env.PUBLIC_ADSENSE_CLIENT);
const name = SITE_CONFIG.name;
---

<InfoLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description={`How ${name} handles your images and data: tools run in your browser, images are never uploaded, and no accounts or tracking are needed.`}
  path="privacy"
  updated="Last updated 27 October 2026"
>
  <p>
    <strong>The short version:</strong> {name} works inside your browser. The images you open are processed on your own device and
    are never uploaded to us. There are no accounts{adsEnabled ? '' : ', no analytics and no tracking cookies'}.
  </p>

  <h2>Who runs this site</h2>
  <p>
    {name} is run by {SITE_CONFIG.operator} in {SITE_CONFIG.operatorCountry}. For any privacy question, email
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE_CONFIG.contactEmail}`}>{SITE_CONFIG.contactEmail}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Your images</h2>
  <p>
    When you open, drop or paste an image, your browser reads it into memory and every tool works on it there, using your device's
    processor and the browser's built-in image features. The result is created on your device and saved through your browser's normal
    download. Your images, and anything you type into a tool, are not sent to us or to anyone else, and we have no way to see them.
    Closing the tab clears them from memory.
  </p>
  <p>
    This also applies to the AI tools: the background remover downloads an AI model to your browser and runs it on your device. The
    model comes to you; your photo does not go anywhere.
  </p>

  <h2>Information your browser sends when you visit</h2>
  <p>
    The site is hosted on Cloudflare. As with any website, your browser sends standard request information (your IP address, browser
    type and the page you asked for) to deliver the pages. Cloudflare may keep this briefly for security and to keep the service
    running; see the <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" rel="noopener">Cloudflare privacy policy</a>. We do not use it
    to identify or track you.
  </p>
  <p>
    Everything the site uses is served from our own domain, including fonts and the background remover's AI models and the software
    that runs them. Your browser does not fetch files from any other provider while you use the tools.
  </p>

  <h2>What is stored on your device</h2>
  <p>
    To remember your choices, the site saves a few small values in your browser's local storage. They stay on your device and are
    never sent to us:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>your preferred language, and whether you dismissed the language suggestion;</li>
    <li>which background-removal model you chose, and which models this browser has already downloaded.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Your browser also caches the site's files and any AI models you downloaded, so pages load faster and the tools keep working
    offline. You can remove all of this at any time by clearing this site's data in your browser settings.
  </p>

  <h2>Advertising and cookies</h2>
  {adsEnabled ? (
    <>
      <p>
        To keep the tools free, the site shows ads from Google AdSense. Google and other third-party vendors use cookies to show ads
        based on your previous visits to this site and other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies lets it and its partners
        show you ads based on those visits.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          You can turn off personalized advertising in <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>,
          and opt out of other vendors' personalized ads at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="noopener">aboutads.info</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          Visitors in the European Economic Area, the United Kingdom and Switzerland are asked for consent through a Google-certified
          consent message before personalized ads are shown.
        </li>
        <li>
          Learn more in <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener">how Google uses information from sites that use its services</a>.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>Ads are placed between sections of the page and never receive your images.</p>
    </>
  ) : (
    <p>
      The site does not show ads and does not set cookies. If ads are added in future, this section will be updated before they appear,
      including how to opt out.
    </p>
  )}

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>The site is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect information from anyone.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Because we do not collect or store personal information about you, there is nothing for us to access, correct or delete. If you
    have a question about your data under India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act, the GDPR or similar laws, email us and we will
    answer.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>If this policy changes, the new version will be posted on this page with a new date at the top.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE_CONFIG.contactEmail}`}>{SITE_CONFIG.contactEmail}</a>, or see the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
  </p>
</InfoLayout>
